# um-texts 1
=== INSTR Axe
Metal axe
Easy to make, easy to use!

=== INSTR Battle_Axe
Metal battle axe
The battle axe is heavier than the simple axe, and it can cause much more damage.

=== INSTR Bone_Club
Bone club
The simplest and most ancient weapon.

=== INSTR Bone_Long_Bow
Long bone bow
An arrow shot with such a bow hits much harder than one shot from the short bow.

=== INSTR Bone_Short_Bow
Short bone bow
This bow is reinforced with bone, making it better than an ordinary one.

=== INSTR Bone_Spear
Bone spear
You can make a bone spearhead sharper than a stone one.

=== INSTR Cheat_Dagger
Ritual knife
Looks rather impressive, but it is not a combat weapon.

=== INSTR Crossbow
Crossbow
This can't shoot as quickly as a bow, but can pierce heavier armor.

=== INSTR Crystal_Axe
Crystal axe
The best possible axe.

=== INSTR Crystal_Crossbow
Crystal crossbow
The best possible crossbow.

=== INSTR Crystal_Dagger
Crystal dagger
The best possible dagger.

=== INSTR Crystal_Mace
Crystal mace
Look at me and die -  that is the crystal mace!

=== INSTR Crystal_Spear
Crystal spear
You cannot find a better spear!

=== INSTR Crystal_Sword
Crystal sword
The best possible sword.

=== INSTR Curved_Dagger
Dirk
Its shape causes more damage than a straight dagger.

=== INSTR Dagger
Dagger
A quick, simple weapon. Use it with a backstab and you will have an edge.

=== INSTR Gipat_Brigand_Boots
Hunting Gipath boots
People who often walk in forests will surely value the softness and comfort provided by fur footwear.

=== INSTR Gipat_Brigand_Gloves
Hunting Gipath gauntlets
Nice decoration and additional protection too!

=== INSTR Gipat_Brigand_Helm
Hunting Gipath helmet
Such headgear should give its owner the strength and cunning of wild beasts!

=== INSTR Gipat_Brigand_Leggins
Hunting Gipath leggings
Of course, you may feel a bit hot in these, but it is a small price to pay for such good leg protection.

=== INSTR Gipat_Brigand_Pants
Hunting Gipath shorts
These shorts provide decent protection and are suitable for long hikes through the forests.

=== INSTR Gipat_Brigand_Plate
Hunting Gipath cloak
This supplements the breastplate, it protects your elbows and shoulders from blows.

=== INSTR Gipat_Brigand_Prototype
Gipat_Brigand_Prototype
Gipat_Brigand_Prototype

=== INSTR Gipat_Brigand_Shirt
Hunting Gipath breastplate
Provides decent protection and looks better than simple breastplate.

=== INSTR Gipat_High_Boots
Stitched Gipath boots
A pair of stitched boots is a couple of steps in the right direction.

=== INSTR Gipat_High_Gloves
Stitched Gipath gauntlets
Cut and stitched gauntlets protect a much bigger part of your arm than light, simple or even hunting gauntlets.

=== INSTR Gipat_High_Helm
Stitched Gipath helmet
If you do not pay for a nicely cut helmet, you can get a nicely cut head!

=== INSTR Gipat_High_Leggins
Stitched Gipath leggings
Extra protection and elegance for extra money!

=== INSTR Gipat_High_Pants
Long stitched Gipath trousers
Due to their cut, they provide much better protection for the legs than shorts.

=== INSTR Gipat_High_Plate
Stitched Gipath coat
Due to efficient use of material, this provides good full-length arm protection.

=== INSTR Gipat_High_Prototype
Gipat_High_Prototype
Gipat_High_Prototype

=== INSTR Gipat_High_Shirt
Stitched Gipath breastplate
It takes longer to make, but provides better shoulder protection.

=== INSTR Gipat_Highest_Boots
Heavy Gipath high boots
The best footwear you can hope to make under the circumstances.

=== INSTR Gipat_Highest_Gloves
Heavy Gipath long gauntlets
Provide practically full-length arm protection.

=== INSTR Gipat_Highest_Helm
Heavy Gipath helmet
Not too impressive to look at, but provides better head protection than any other Gipath helmet.

=== INSTR Gipat_Highest_Leggins
Heavy Gipath leggings
If you wear them on top of long trousers, you will have better leg protection than with any other Gipath armor.

=== INSTR Gipat_Highest_Pants
Heavy Gipath long trousers
Good protection from the belt down to the ankles.

=== INSTR Gipat_Highest_Plate
Heavy Gipath coat
No other Gipath armor can give you better arm and shoulder protection.

=== INSTR Gipat_Highest_Prototype
